==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|EX Legend Maker|Victreebel|13}} from the {{TCG|EX Legend Maker}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Victreebel}}.
*'''Fragrance Trap''' is an {{TCG|Ability}} that first appeared as a {{TCG|Pokémon Power}} on {{TCG ID|Gym Heroes|Erika's Victreebel|26}} from the {{TCG|Gym Heroes}} expansion. It has only ever been featured on {{TCG|Victreebel}} cards.
*{{m|Vine Whip}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Victreebel}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|X}}.

